{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls6_jpg\\drawing\\014.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Art is fun so take it easy and enjoy it.", "conf": 0.945, "box": [[230, 166], [831, 151], [832, 214], [232, 229]]}, {"text": "Feel free and be expressive.", "conf": 0.909, "box": [[239, 511], [671, 494], [673, 542], [241, 558]]}, {"text": "Discuss and compare your work with that of your class-fellows but avoid comments", "conf": 0.948, "box": [[241, 614], [1502, 599], [1503, 652], [242, 668]]}, {"text": "that may discourage anyone.", "conf": 0.958, "box": [[245, 678], [698, 666], [699, 712], [246, 724]]}, {"text": "Share ideas with your teacher and class-fellows.", "conf": 0.903, "box": [[244, 789], [991, 771], [992, 814], [245, 832]]}, {"text": "Let there be a friendly and co-operative environment in the class. Still you must be", "conf": 0.888, "box": [[246, 900], [1495, 862], [1496, 908], [248, 946]]}, {"text": "quite disciplined.", "conf": 0.904, "box": [[249, 959], [519, 947], [521, 994], [251, 1005]]}, {"text": "You shall be able to complete your work only if there is no disturbance and you co-", "conf": 0.917, "box": [[250, 1065], [1490, 1018], [1492, 1064], [252, 1111]]}, {"text": "operate with your classmates and teacher.", "conf": 0.934, "box": [[250, 1123], [903, 1092], [905, 1138], [252, 1169]]}, {"text": "ngilab.co", "conf": 0.789, "box": [[790, 1178], [993, 1061], [1023, 1113], [820, 1230]]}, {"text": "When your teacher is giving instructions, listen very carefully so that you clearly", "conf": 0.937, "box": [[248, 1228], [1494, 1168], [1496, 1217], [250, 1277]]}, {"text": "know what you are supposed to do in the class.", "conf": 0.946, "box": [[247, 1282], [965, 1246], [968, 1298], [249, 1335]]}, {"text": "Take good care of your and your drawing material.", "conf": 0.915, "box": [[256, 1389], [1080, 1343], [1083, 1396], [259, 1442]]}, {"text": "BASIC STROKES", "conf": 0.91, "box": [[71, 1553], [482, 1550], [482, 1600], [71, 1603]]}, {"text": "Holding a Pencil", "conf": 0.815, "